{
  "answer": "The customary progress payment rate is 80 percent of total contract costs, and for contracts with small business concerns it is 85 percent [[q1]]. For undefinitized contract actions the progress payment limit is 80 percent of work accomplished [[q1]].",
  "quotes": [
    {
      "source": "q1",
      "text": "(a) The customary progress payment rate is 80 percent, applicable to the total costs of performing the contract. The customary rate for contracts with small business concerns is 85 percent."
    },
    {
      "source": "q1",
      "text": "(d) In accordance with 10 U.S.C. 3804(b) and 41 U.S.C. 4504(b), the limit for progress payments is 80 percent on work accomplished under undefinitized contract actions."
    }
  ]
}
